  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HL EDUCATION FOR PEACE GENEVA INITIATIVE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Building an Infrastructure for Peace and Reconciliation: Israeli and Palestinian Youth project will train hundreds of young Israeli and Palestinian leaders on reconciliation, peace and the two-state solution. Teaching this key demographic how to addresses the most sensitive identity and narrative-based issues of the conflict is vital in building a broader and stronger support base for advancing the two-state solution. Young leaders will undergo an intensive process of knowledge-building, skills development and joint meetings with their counterparts, to imbue them with renewed belief in the viability of reaching a negotiated settlement, increase their understanding for the other side&apos;s perspective and bolster their motivation to promote the issues among their audiences.</narrative>
  </description>
